{
  "schema": "goalmaker/prompts@1",
  "version": 1,
  "description": "The reflection prompts the weekly, monthly and yearly reviews ask (docs/reviews.md, spec stories 62 and 63). A prompt has an id ('<category>/<name>', what reviews.reflections stores), the reviews it suits, and its text. '{period}' in a text is replaced by week, month or year. A prompt with a 'trigger' is asked only when the period's facts call for it, and '{subject}' is replaced by the habit, task or goal that triggered it. The rotation and the triggers are pinned by contracts/vectors/reviews.json, sections 'rotation' and 'reactive'.",
